The axone is -3.
The ayone is 0.
The axtwo is 3.
The aytwo is 4.
The bxone is 0.
The byone is -1.
The bxtwo is 9.
The bytwo is 2.
The awidth is axtwo minus axone.
The aheight is aytwo minus ayone.
The barea is awidth times aheight.
The bwidth is bxtwo minus bxone.
The bheight is bytwo minus byone.
The bcarea is bwidth times bheight.
The leftedge is axone.
If bxone is more than leftedge, set leftedge to bxone.
The rightedge is axtwo.
If bxtwo is less than rightedge, set rightedge to bxtwo.
The bottomedge is ayone.
If byone is more than bottomedge, set bottomedge to byone.
The topedge is aytwo.
If bytwo is less than topedge, set topedge to bytwo.
The overlapwidth is rightedge minus leftedge.
The overlapheight is topedge minus bottomedge.
The total is barea plus bcarea.
If overlapwidth is more than 0 and overlapheight is more than 0, The overlaparea is overlapwidth times overlapheight, set total to total minus overlaparea.

Show total.
